@baseUrl = http://localhost:53425
@customerToken = paste-customer-access-token
@ownerToken = paste-owner-access-token
@spaceId = 1
@bookingId = 1
@spaceRowVersion = paste-quote-spaceRowVersion
@rowVersion = paste-booking-rowVersion

### Set future dates and configure the space's working hours first
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/spaces/{{spaceId}}/availability?startsAt=2026-12-01T06:00:00Z&endsAt=2026-12-01T08:00:00Z&attendeeCount=20
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Quote without package/services
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/booking-quotes
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"spaceId":{{spaceId}},"startsAt":"2026-12-01T10:00:00+04:00","endsAt":"2026-12-01T12:00:00+04:00","attendeeCount":20,"packageId":null,"additionalServices":[]}

### Create from quote; copy the booking id and rowVersion
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"spaceId":{{spaceId}},"startsAt":"2026-12-01T10:00:00+04:00","endsAt":"2026-12-01T12:00:00+04:00","attendeeCount":20,"packageId":null,"additionalServices":[],"spaceRowVersion":"{{spaceRowVersion}}"}

### My requests
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me/bookings?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Owner's pending requests
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me/received-bookings?status=0
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### Details (refresh rowVersion before a decision)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### Confirm pending
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"rowVersion":"{{rowVersion}}"}

### Alternative: reject pending
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason":"Space maintenance","rowVersion":"{{rowVersion}}"}

### Customer cancellation, observing the 24-hour confirmed-booking rule
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason":"Plans changed","rowVersion":"{{rowVersion}}"}
